The '''Great Hall''',<ref name="Jedi's Duty">{{StoryCite|story=A Jedi's Duty|book=Stories of Jedi and Sith}}</ref> also known as the '''Jedi Temple Main Hallway''',<ref name="VE">''[[Star Wars: The Visual Encyclopedia]]''</ref> was a room within the [[Imperial Palace|Jedi Temple]] on [[Coruscant]]. Leading in the Temple from the [[Processional Way]],<ref name="SWCL">[[Star Wars: Complete Locations (2016)|''Star Wars: Complete Locations'']]</ref> the hall featured a wide raised walkway going through it and was lined with massive pillars and grand statues on it's lower levels, including one of a [[human]]<ref name="ROTS" /> [[Unidentified Jedi priestess|Jedi priestess]]<ref name="Crash of Fate">''[[A Crash of Fate]]''</ref> holding a [[book]] in one hand and a ball permanently floating above her other outstretched arm.<ref name="ROTS" /> Another hall similar, but distinct from the Great Hall, also existed in the Temple.<ref name="Part I">{{Kenobi|Part I}}</ref>

==History==
During her [[time]] as part of an [[Barriss Offee's Initiate clan|Initiate clan]], the [[Mirialan]] [[Gender|female]] [[Barriss Offee]] and her clan wandered through the high archways and manicured courtyards of the Great Hall, which Offee marveled at.<ref name="Jedi's Duty" /> In [[19 BBY]],<ref name="Timelines">''[[Star Wars: Timelines]]''</ref> [[Supreme Chancellor]] of the [[Galactic Republic]] and secretly a [[Dark Lord of the Sith]] [[Darth Sidious|Sheev Palpatine]], ordered the [[Grand Army of the Republic]] to [[Great Jedi Purge|eliminate]] all Jedi. [[Operation: Knightfall|Marching]] into the Temple under the leadership of former [[Jedi Knight]] [[Anakin Skywalker]], the [[501st Legion]] destroyed the Great Hall as they slaughtered the Jedi that occupied the Temple. Afterwards Jedi Master [[Obi-Wan Kenobi]] and [[Grand Master]] [[Yoda]] [[Infiltration of the Jedi Temple|infiltrated]] the Temple and saw multiple dead [[Jedi Initiate|Younglings]] lying in the Great Hall.<ref name="ROTS" />

